    {
      "id": "p0078-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale begins when the main character visits a mountain known as \"Mt. Ebott\". It's not obvious at first glance, but this isn't some random name - it's simply \"Toby\" backwards, spelled in a roundabout way.",
        "raw": "Undertale begins when the main character visits a mountain known as \"Mt.\nEbott\". It's not obvious at first glance, but this isn't some random name - it's\nsimply \"Toby\" backwards, spelled in a roundabout way.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29660275,
          0.27586429,
          0.87738292,
          0.32514286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29050692,
          0.27515,
          0.90555581,
          0.32621429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          9,
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 开始时，主角来到一座叫 Mt. Ebott 的山。乍看不明显，但这并非随手起的名字：它只是将 Toby 倒过来，再绕点弯子拼出来。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
