      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0078-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This naming choice was inspired by a similar mountain in Earth.Bound Beginnings known as \"Mt. Itoi\", which is a reference to Shigesato Itoi, the game's creator. In the original Japanese version of Earth.Bound Beginnings, however, this mountain was known as \"Holy Loly Mountain\". This difference meant that Toby's homage to the Earth.Bound series was destined to be lost in translation.",
        "raw": "This naming choice was inspired by a similar mountain in Earth.Bound\nBeginnings known as \"Mt. Itoi\", which is a reference to Shigesato Itoi, the game's\ncreator. In the original Japanese version of Earth.Bound Beginnings, however,\nthis mountain was known as \"Holy Loly Mountain\". This difference meant that\nToby's homage to the Earth.Bound series was destined to be lost in translation.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29587125,
          0.34102857,
          0.89744836,
          0.42422143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29050692,
          0.34031429,
          0.90555581,
          0.42529286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          14,
          15,
          16
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这个命名方式来自 EarthBound Beginnings 中类似的一座山——Mt. Itoi，指的是游戏创作者 Shigesato Itoi。不过，在该作日语原版中，这座山名叫 Holy Loly Mountain。因此，Toby 对 EarthBound 系列的这份致敬，注定会在翻译中丢失。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 30,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 120,
            "end": 130,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
