    {
      "id": "p0078-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "By changing the mountain's name, the translator was able to preserve Toby's original intent as closely as possible. However, the change from \"Ebott\" to \"Ibito\" also meant that most Japanese players would know the mountain by a different name than the rest of the world.",
        "raw": "By changing the mountain's name, the translator was able to preserve Toby's\noriginal intent as closely as possible. However, the change from \"Ebott\" to\n\"Ibito\" also meant that most Japanese players would know the mountain by a\ndifferent name than the rest of the world.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29253886,
          0.83246429,
          0.88242214,
          0.89955
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29050692,
          0.83175,
          0.90555581,
          0.90062143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          48,
          49,
          50,
          51
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "通过改名，译者尽可能保住了 Toby 原本的用意。不过，从 Ebott 改成 Ibito，也意味着多数日本玩家熟悉的山名，会与世界其他地方不同。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
